  def heading "Target Users"
    level 2

  def heading "Primary Persona: Emily - Content Creator"
    level 3

  def paragraph "Emily, 28, freelance content writer and blogger. Creates 10-15 articles per week. Struggles with writer's block and tight deadlines."

  def list
    items """Demographics: 25-35, remote worker, tech-savvy
Goals: Write faster, improve quality, meet deadlines consistently
Pain points: Blank page anxiety, self-doubt, time pressure
Tech savviness: Advanced - comfortable with AI tools"""

  def heading "Secondary Persona: Marcus - Product Manager"
    level 3

  def paragraph "Marcus, 34, PM at a SaaS company. Writes PRDs, specs, and updates. Needs clear, professional communication."

  def list
    items """Demographics: 30-45, corporate environment, busy schedule
Goals: Communicate clearly, save time, maintain consistency
Pain points: Too many meetings, limited writing time, imposter syndrome
Tech savviness: Intermediate - uses productivity tools actively"""

  def heading "User Stories & Use Cases"
    level 2

  def list
    listtype numbered
    items """As Emily, I want AI to suggest an opening paragraph, so I can overcome blank page anxiety
As Emily, I want to expand bullet points into full paragraphs, so I can write faster
As Marcus, I want to improve tone and clarity of my writing, so stakeholders understand better
As Marcus, I want to generate summaries of long documents, so I can save time
As both, I want to fix grammar and spelling automatically, so I appear professional"""

  def heading "Requirements"
    level 2

  def heading "Must Have (P0) - Launch Blockers"
    level 3

  def list
    items """⚡ AI Command Palette: Cmd/Ctrl+K to trigger AI actions anywhere
✍️ Continue Writing: AI suggests next sentences based on context
✨ Improve Selection: Rewrite selected text for clarity/tone
📝 Expand Bullets: Convert bullet points to full paragraphs
📋 Summarize: Generate TL;DR of selected text
🔤 Fix Grammar & Spelling: Auto-correct with AI
⚙️ Settings: Model selection (GPT-4, Claude), tone preferences
🔐 Privacy: All data encrypted, opt-in only, GDPR compliant"""

  def heading "Should Have (P1) - Post-Launch (2 weeks)"
    level 3

  def list
    items """🌍 Translate: Convert text to 12+ languages
🎯 Change Tone: Professional, casual, persuasive, friendly
💡 Generate Ideas: Brainstorm related topics or next sections
📊 Custom Prompts: Save and reuse personal AI commands"""

  def heading "Could Have (P2) - Future Iteration"
    level 3

  def list
    items """🗣️ Voice to Text: Dictate and AI cleans up transcription
🔗 Research Assistant: AI fetches and cites web sources
👥 Team Templates: Share AI prompts across workspace"""

  def heading "User Experience"
    level 2

  def paragraph "The AI assistant is accessible via a floating action button or Cmd/Ctrl+K command palette. Users select text or place cursor, trigger AI action, and see real-time streaming responses. Accepted suggestions are inserted seamlessly."

  def mermaid block_36
    src """sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Editor
    participant AI
    
    User->>Editor: Presses Cmd+K
    Editor->>User: Shows AI Command Palette
    User->>Editor: Selects \"Continue Writing\"
    Editor->>AI: Send context (last 500 chars)
    AI->>Editor: Stream response (SSE)
    Editor->>User: Display suggestion (typewriter effect)
    User->>Editor: Accepts or Rejects
    Editor->>Editor: Insert at cursor or discard"""

  def callout "🎨 Design Principle: AI should feel like a helpful collaborator, not a replacement. Users maintain full control and can edit/reject any suggestion."

  def heading "Out of Scope"
    level 2

  def paragraph "Explicitly NOT included in v2.5 release:"

  def list
    items """❌ Image generation (Midjourney, DALL-E integration)
❌ Multi-user collaborative AI (team editing with AI)
❌ AI chat interface (separate from document editing)
❌ Training on user data (all models are pre-trained)"""

  def heading "Technical Considerations"
    level 2

  def list
    items """Platform: Web (React), Desktop (Electron), Mobile (React Native) - phase 2
AI Provider: OpenAI GPT-4 Turbo (primary), Anthropic Claude 3 (backup)
Performance: Streaming responses (SSE), < 2 second latency
Rate Limits: 50 AI requests/hour for free, unlimited for premium
Cost: $0.02 per request (avg), target $1.50/user/month
Security: End-to-end encryption, no data retention, SOC 2 compliant"""

  def heading "Risks & Assumptions"
    level 2

  def heading "Risks"
    level 3

